OL,3,APolanski defends leadership after
OL,4,AZionism row and by-election loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe insisted "nobody will be excluded in
OL,7,Fthe Green Party based on faith and
OL,8,Freligion", as he sought to reassure
OL,9,FJewish members who raised concerns
OL,10,Fabout the motion.
OL,12,FEarlier, ex-party leader Caroline Lucas
OL,13,Ftold the BBC Polanski had failed to
OL,14,Fshow leadership over the motion.
